# Orchestrator pipeline artifacts
.orchestrator/

# Accidental root artifacts from misquoted version specifiers
# (e.g. `pip install foo>=1.11.0` without quotes writes stdout to a file
# named `=1.11.0`). Root-anchored so legitimate `foo=bar` filenames in
# subdirectories aren't affected. See task prevent-semver-root-artifacts.
/=*
